# Mod jars that aren't ours (other people's mods we don't republish here) or are too big for git (GitHub
# refuses files over 100 MB). They're listed, with a fingerprint, in externals.txt; tools/build-pack.ps1
# takes them from the CurseForge instance when it makes the zip. Only our own mods are committed.
overrides/mods/*.jar
!overrides/mods/bandits-*.jar
!overrides/mods/realism-*.jar
!overrides/mods/sapper_zombie-*.jar
# Build output
/build/
